===Etymology===
From earlier {{term||septmāginta}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{m|ine-pro|*septm̥̄ḱomt}}, from earlier {{m|ine-pro|*septḿ̥-dḱomt||seven-ten}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|ἑβδομήκοντα|lang=grc}}.

